    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993400/extras/112932fd17425c9380aa33fd59e81877.poster.avif?t=1730306673\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993400/extras/112932fd17425c9380aa33fd59e81877.webm?t=1730306673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993400/extras/112932fd17425c9380aa33fd59e81877.mp4?t=1730306673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Secret of Lands is an engaging, action-adventure game with a Epic aesthetic. You play as a young hero on a quest to become the new world champion. Navigate through a variety of thrilling adventures and activities, battling formidable bosses and uncovering the secrets of the lands, all in a captivating world filled with vibrant landscapes and intriguing characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>The journey begins in a tranquil village and takes you through diverse environments, from snow-covered terrains to majestic castles, each presenting unique challenges and epic battles. Experience mechanics that change and vary throughout the game, keeping the gameplay fresh and exciting. Face cunning adversaries, uncover hidden secrets, and prove your might in this exciting, stress-free gaming experience with an intuitive learning curve.<br><br>Can you overcome the obstacles and achieve glory?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993400/extras/112932fd17425c9380aa33fd59e81877.poster.avif?t=1730306673\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993400/extras/112932fd17425c9380aa33fd59e81877.webm?t=1730306673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993400/extras/112932fd17425c9380aa33fd59e81877.mp4?t=1730306673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Secret of Lands is an engaging, action-adventure game with a Epic aesthetic. You play as a young hero on a quest to become the new world champion. Navigate through a variety of thrilling adventures and activities, battling formidable bosses and uncovering the secrets of the lands, all in a captivating world filled with vibrant landscapes and intriguing characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>The journey begins in a tranquil village and takes you through diverse environments, from snow-covered terrains to majestic castles, each presenting unique challenges and epic battles. Experience mechanics that change and vary throughout the game, keeping the gameplay fresh and exciting. Face cunning adversaries, uncover hidden secrets, and prove your might in this exciting, stress-free gaming experience with an intuitive learning curve.<br><br>Can you overcome the obstacles and achieve glory?",
